title: "ORCA: Operational store, Read models, Change capture, Anti-corruption layer"
abstract: >-
  An architectural pattern for building a fast, independent application platform on top of a system you do not own
  and cannot change: a translated, live copy for reads, with every write sent back through the vendor.
